  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social work Kaluga 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Socialarbutbildn Kaluga 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det l&#xe5;ngsiktiga m&#xe5;let med projektet &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka kompetensen inom de sociala myndigheterna att fortbilda socialarbetare inom hela oblasten. Alla utbildningskurser h&#xe5;lls i seminarieform med gruppdiskussioner, lokala studiebes&#xf6;k, redovisningar och arbete i grupp.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to follow-up implementation of phase I of a previous project, with the overall purpose to strengthen the capacities of the social authorities in Kaluga oblast to provide continuous education for staff working in the social sector across the oblast. Major activities include training of staff in various positions in the social sector and development of modern pedagogic.</narrative>
  </description>
